<entry key="OpenBikeCAD.material">Mild / high-tensile ERW steel, fillet brazed (bronze)</entry>
<entry key="OpenBikeCAD.drawingDate"></entry>
<entry key="OpenBikeCAD.notes">Twin straight-tube step-through. Second (upper) tube meets the seat tube 150 mm above BB centre. Wishbone seatstays (2 x 19.05 stays to a 130 mm yoke, 25.4 mono stay) clear the 56 mm tyre, fender and ring lock; chainstays dimpled 7 mm at tyre and chainring. Rear: horizontal forward-facing dropouts, 132 mm OLD for Shimano Nexus 7/8 (with non-turn washers). Braze-ons: V-brake posts front+rear, fender eyelets, rear rack mounts rated for an adult passenger (~100 kg), chainguard tabs, two-leg kickstand plate behind BB, ring-lock bosses on seatstays, 1 bottle mount, front carrier-block bosses on head tube. E-ASSIST VARIANT: 250 W geared front hub motor (100 mm OLD, 10 mm axle with flats; fork dropouts 6 mm plate, 10 mm slots, anti-rotation washers both sides). 36 V 10 Ah (360 Wh) slide-in battery with key lock on a steel cradle bolted to the front carrier block; controller in the cradle below the pack; headlight on the cradle. Cadence sensor at BB. Assist cut-off 25 km/h. No front luggage: loads go on the rear rack.</entry>
